---
source: crates/easyplay/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Launch a game

Usage: easyplay launch [OPTIONS] <GAME> [-- <EXTRA ARGS>...]

Arguments:
  <GAME>           The game
  [EXTRA ARGS]...  Extra arguments for this run only, after `--`

Options:
      --exe <LABEL|ID>  Which program of the game (label or ID; default the primary one)
  -v, --verbose...      Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
      --wait            Wait until the game ends; exit 0 for a normal end, 1 for failure to start, 2 for a crash
  -h, --help            Print help
